<title>USA: N.J. Housing $47 mln revs priced by Goldman Sachs.</title>
<headline>N.J. Housing $47 mln revs priced by Goldman Sachs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it tentatively priced $47 million of New Jersey Housing and Mortgage Finance Agency multi-family housing revenue bonds, with a top tax-exempt yield of 6.25 percent in 2028.</p>
<p>The bonds are AMBAC insured.</p>
